## Signature

- Provided by: **Laguna S 2.1 (poolside/laguna-s-2.1)** — 2026-10-09
- Method: Public web research via OpenRouter API, Artificial Analysis model page, CloudPrice model page, and DuckDuckGo search. Searched for the exact model name "gemini-3.1-flash" and the slug "gemini-3-1-flash" across all platforms. The exact model was not found on any platform. The closest match is "gemini-3-1-flash-lite" (deprecated in favor of other Gemini 3.x models), but this is a different model with different capabilities (Queue Overall: 75.8 vs 78.4 for the target). No verified public benchmark numbers were found for the exact model name "gemini-3.1-flash". Scores are not computed.
- Sources searched:
  - OpenRouter API: Model list does not contain "gemini-3.1-flash". Only "gemini-3.1-flash-lite", "gemini-3.1-flash-image", and "gemini-3.1-pro-preview" exist.
  - Artificial Analysis (artificialanalysis.ai): Model page at `/models/gemini-3-1-flash` returns the generic leaderboard page. The model list JSON contains `gemini-3-1-flash-lite` and `gemini-3-1-flash-lite-preview` but NOT `gemini-3-1-flash`.
  - CloudPrice (cloudprice.net): Model page at `/models/google-gemini-3-1-flash` redirects to "Gemini 3.1 Flash Image" pricing & specs (an image generation model, not a text LLM). No text-LLM variant found.
  - Hugging Face: No model card found for "gemini-3.1-flash".
  - DuckDuckGo: Search results only mention "Gemini 3.1 Flash-Lite", not "Gemini 3.1 Flash" (non-Lite). A DeepMind PDF at `storage.googleapis.com/deepmind-media/gemini/gemini_3-1_flash-lite_model_evaluation.pdf` references "Flash-Lite" exclusively.
  - models.dev: API returns empty response; no model found.
- Future sources: If "gemini-3.1-flash" is published with benchmark data on OpenRouter, AA, or CloudPrice in the future, replace this excluded file with a scored report.
